      "content": "thanks for this. it's a good start but honestly it feels a bit too surface-level for what we need. the supervisor is really picky about the 'technicality' of these briefs. even though i said not to spam it, the density score on this one was actually a bit low compared to what they expect for a 'deep-dive'. \n\ncan you try again? maybe expand more on the biochemical mechanisms and the molecular interactions involved? i really need it to hit a higher technical density so it doesn't get flagged as too 'layman', but please just make sure the science stays accurate and isn't just a bunch of words thrown together.",
